title: "Agri-PV Geometric Simulator"
version: "158.0"
date-released: "2026-10-18"
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23450984
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sa-ard"
    given-names: "Tossaphon"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TossaphonPVagri/Agri-PV_SIM"
url: "https://tossaphonpvagri.github.io/Agri-PV_SIM/"
abstract: >-
  Single-file browser simulator for agrivoltaic systems. One 3-D model of every module drives
  per-cell ground beam shading (exact polygon union), per-cell sky-view factors, crop light
  (RSR, DLI) by zone and month from NASA POWER climatology, and electricity yield
  with ray-traced front and rear irradiance for every module.
keywords:
  - agrivoltaics
  - ground shading
  - sky-view factor
  - daily light integral
  - bifacial photovoltaics
  - ray tracing
